{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Design and implement REST endpoints in Spring Cloud Data Flow (s-c-d) server for uploading and dynamically registering module coordinates.",
    "Refactor ModuleRegistryPopulator and underlying ModuleRegistry services to support dynamic module registration backed by persistent storage/repository instead of static bootstrap initializers.",
    "Extend the Spring Cloud Data Flow Shell CLI with commands for uploading custom module binaries/artifacts and registering module URIs.",
    "Port the 6 specified legacy Spring XD modules (jms, mail, mongo, mqtt, reactor-ip, stdout) into Spring Cloud Stream / Spring Cloud Stream Modules repositories, converting them into Spring Boot / Spring Cloud Stream apps."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The developer has full access to repository codebases (Spring Cloud Data Flow server/shell, spring-cloud-stream-modules, spring-cloud-stream).",
    "Standard CI/CD infrastructure, test harnesses, and repository artifacts (e.g., Maven/Nexus/Artifactory) are already established.",
    "Module migration involves adapting Spring XD integration flows to Spring Cloud Stream binder abstractions and updating dependencies and unit/integration tests."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-1",
      "activity_name": "Technical Design & REST API Specification for Dynamic Module Upload",
      "activity_description": "Analyze user stories U1 and U2, design REST API contracts for module upload and dynamic registration, and architect changes to the ModuleRegistry backend.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-2",
      "activity_name": "s-c-d Server Backend Implementation for Module Upload & Registry",
      "activity_description": "Implement REST controllers, upload services, artifact storage handling, and dynamic module registration logic in spring-cloud-dataflow-server.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-3",
      "activity_name": "s-c-d Shell Commands Implementation",
      "activity_description": "Add new CLI commands and options in spring-cloud-dataflow-shell to allow users to register and upload modules via REST API.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-4",
      "activity_name": "Module Registry Refactoring (ModuleRegistryPopulator)",
      "activity_description": "Refactor hardcoded bootstrap module registration (ModuleRegistryPopulator) to enable dynamic runtime updates and state persistence.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-5",
      "activity_name": "Port Spring XD Modules (JMS, Mail, Mongo, MQTT, Reactor-IP, Stdout)",
      "activity_description": "Migrate, refactor, and write unit tests for jms, mail, and mongo modules into s-c-s-m, and mqtt, reactor-ip, and stdout modules into s-c-s repositories.",
      "most_likely_effort": 6.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-6",
      "activity_name": "Integration & End-to-End Testing",
      "activity_description": "Conduct integration testing of custom module uploads, dynamic registry updates, and stream/task execution using migrated modules.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-7",
      "activity_name": "Documentation & Release Preparation",
      "activity_description": "Document new REST API endpoints, shell commands, and module registry updates; prepare PRs and release notes.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 19.0
  }
}
```

